BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Beach Metro Community News
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260910T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260910T203000
DTSTAMP:20260828T133702Z
CREATED:20260827T215924Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260828T133702Z
UID:52696-1789065000-1789072200@beachmetro.com
SUMMARY:Slide Night
DESCRIPTION:📽️✨Join us for Slide Night\, an interactive evening celebrating the joy of physical media! \nAs a part of our ArtLabs program\, we’ll explore art\, photography\, and memory-making through 35mm photo slides with photographer Shebonti Khandaker. 📸 \n🌳✨After the slide viewing\, we’ll head to Riverdale Park to create our own photographic prints through experimental\, hands-on processes! \n🗓️ Saturday\, September 10\, 2026\n🕡 6:30–8:30 PM\n📍 St. Matthew’s Clubhouse\, 450 Broadview Ave\n👥 All ages welcome\n🎟️ FREE/PWYC — proceeds support event materials \n💌 Have 35mm slides or family photographs you’d like to share? Email shebontikhandaker@gmail.com with a sample of your images for a chance to have them displayed or projected! \n🎟️ Register here: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/slide-night-tickets-1998995064048?aff=oddtdtcreator \n🎨 Poster designed by Jocelyn Zin.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/slide-night/
LOCATION:St. Matthew’s Clubhouse\, 450 Broadview Avenue\, Toronto\, M4K 2N3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27175927/SlideNight_IG_1.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="East End Arts":MAILTO:info@eastendarts.ca
END:VEVENT
