SUMMARY:Legion Week
DESCRIPTION:In recognition of the 100th Anniversary of the Royal Canadian Legion\, Legion Week (Sept. 21-25) is presented by Br. 11 at host Branch 22\, Monday to Thursday 10 a.m.-7 p.m.\, Friday 10 a.m.-3:30 p.m. This free event is open to the public and features a Canadian history learning experience\, memorabilia of veterans past and present\, uniforms to try on and veterans on hand to talk with. TEACHERS: call for appt. time for students’ tour: Helen Pearce 416-690-6388 or helends4pearce@bell.net
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/legion-week/
LOCATION:RCL Branch 22\, 1240 Woodbine Ave.\, Toronto
